### Authoritative Data Direction

Android is the primary data source.

The following operations must be supported:

| Resource | Main direction |
|---|---|
| Incoming SMS | Android → iPhone |
| SMS history | Android → iPhone |
| Sending SMS | iPhone → Android → Cellular Network |
| Contacts | Bidirectional management |
| Call history | Android → iPhone |
| Incoming call events | Android → iPhone |
| Answer / Reject / Hang Up | iPhone → Android |
| Outgoing call request | iPhone → Android |
| Device status | Bidirectional |

For bidirectional contacts, Android Contacts Provider remains the authoritative store.

Contact changes received from iOS must be validated and applied to Android through ContactsContract when the user has granted WRITE_CONTACTS.

