# 15. Audio Capability and Prototype

Implement the audio module as an isolated capability.

Files:

AudioCapabilityChecker.kt
LocalAudioBridge.kt
AudioCaptureSource.kt
AudioPlaybackSink.kt
AudioEffectsManager.kt

Important platform restriction:

Normal third-party Android applications cannot assume direct access to cellular downlink and uplink audio.

VOICE_CALL, VOICE_UPLINK and VOICE_DOWNLINK require privileged access to CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT.

Do not request this protected permission as if it could be granted to an ordinary application.

AudioRecord with MIC or VOICE_COMMUNICATION is only a microphone/audio test path.

AudioTrack does not inject arbitrary audio into a cellular call.

Therefore:

- Implement microphone loopback testing.
- Implement PCM network transport abstractions.
- Implement capability detection.
- Report cellular audio capture as unavailable when unsupported.
- Do not advertise the entire audio bridge as complete.
- Keep a clearly isolated extension point for privileged/OEM hardware implementations.

Do not compromise the SMS and call-control modules because of this limitation.

